			"source": "<!--\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\nComplete attribution and permission: LICENSE-cc218c56cbae37d52284e1c809c9f1fa1ec7b700ec117ac86a31086fcc2e8df5.txt\nIncluded in the source bundle; notice resource: /licenses/source-notices/cc218c56cbae37d52284e1c809c9f1fa1ec7b700ec117ac86a31086fcc2e8df5.txt\n-->\n<template>\n\t<div aria-label=\"完整页头示例\">\n\t\t<AsamPageHeader @back=\"onBack\">\n\t\t\t<template #breadcrumb>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumb separator=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumbItem :to=\"{ path: './page-header.html' }\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t首页\n\t\t\t\t\t</AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<AsamLink href=\"/component-AsamPageHeader.html\">路由一</AsamLink>\n\t\t\t\t\t</AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamBreadcrumbItem>路由二</AsamBreadcrumbItem>\n\t\t\t\t</AsamBreadcrumb>\n\t\t\t</template>\n\t\t\t<template #content>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamAvatar\n\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"mr-3\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t:size=\"32\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tsrc=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%22180%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22320%22%20height%3D%22180%22%20fill%3D%22%238899aa%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22240%22%20cy%3D%2245%22%20r%3D%2228%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20180L100%2060L220%20180%22%20fill%3D%22%2340566c%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2212%22%20y%3D%2230%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3EASAM%20%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"\n\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-large font-600 mr-3\"> 标题 </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-sm mr-2\" style=\"color: var(--el-text-color-regular)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t副标题\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamTag>默认</AsamTag>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</template>\n\t\t\t<template #extra>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamButton type=\"primary\">打印</AsamButton>\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamButton type=\"primary\" class=\"ml-2\">编辑</AsamButton>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</template>\n\n\t\t\t<AsamDescriptions :column=\"3\" size=\"small\" class=\"mt-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"用户名\"> kooriookami </AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"电话\"> 18100000000 </AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"地点\">苏州</AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"备注\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<AsamTag size=\"small\">学校</AsamTag>\n\t\t\t\t</AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t\t<AsamDescriptionsItem label=\"地址\">\n\t\t\t\t\t江苏省苏州市吴中区吴中大道 1188 号\n\t\t\t\t</AsamDescriptionsItem>\n\t\t\t</AsamDescriptions>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-4 text-sm\">\n\t\t\t\t说明文本示例：通常按周发布；关键问题采用紧急修复，实际发布次数可能调整。\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</AsamPageHeader>\n\t</div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\ndefineOptions({ name: 'AsamPageHeaderCapCompleteDemo' });\nimport {\n\tAsamLink,\n\tAsamPageHeader,\n\tAsamBreadcrumb,\n\tAsamBreadcrumbItem,\n\tAsamAvatar,\n\tAsamTag,\n\tAsamButton,\n\tAsamDescriptions,\n\tAsamDescriptionsItem\n} from '@asam-ui/ui';\nimport { AsamNotification as notify } from '@asam-ui/ui';\nconst onBack = () => {\n\tnotify('Back');\n};\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n/* Local styles keep this sample runnable without a website utility-CSS preset. */\n.flex {\n\tdisplay: flex;\n}\n\n.items-center {\n\talign-items: center;\n}\n\n.mr-3 {\n\tmargin-right: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.text-large {\n\tfont-size: var(--el-font-size-large);\n}\n\n.font-600 {\n\tfont-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.text-sm {\n\tfont-size: var(--el-font-size-small);\n}\n\n.mr-2 {\n\tmargin-right: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.ml-2 {\n\tmargin-left: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.mt-4 {\n\tmargin-top: 1rem;\n}\n</style>\n",
